	fi
fi
sound EF3.aac
text @[Kotomi]
text Then... then what was inside?
text The gentleman answers the confused Kotomi.
sound EF4.aac
text @[Gentleman]
text It was a catalog of stuffed animals that the professor had obtained.
sound EF5.aac
text @[Gentleman]
text I remember it even now.
sound EF6.aac
text @[Gentleman]
text It was a few days before the special lecture had been scheduled.
sound EF7.aac
text @[Gentleman]
text He usually never spoke of his family, so it was a rare occurrence.
sound EF8.aac
text @[Gentleman]
text He told us that his daughter had asked him for a present for the first time.
sound EF9.aac
text @[Gentleman]
text He said that's why he had to give her the best possible present. He was so happy as he spoke of it.
sound EFA.aac
text @[Gentleman]
text He must have been carefully considering which present to choose.
text That's right.
text The adults had been telling that to Kotomi as she cried.
text "This wasn't it."
text "You don't need to cry."
text "This was something for you."
sound EFB.aac
text @[Gentleman]
text But you were inconsolable at the time and would not listen to us.
sound EFC.aac
text @[Gentleman]
text In the end, we wanted to correct this misunderstanding.
sound EFD.aac
text @[Gentleman]
text But we didn't think you would believe us, and we were afraid that it would become a further burden to you.
sound EFE.aac
text @[Gentleman]
text But I think you will believe us now.
text Kotomi quietly listens as the gentleman explains.
text Her eyes are just like those of when she was a child.
